---
description: Build Spec immutability and rebaseline rules
alwaysApply: true
---

- build-spec/CURRENT.json names the only active baseline.
- Baselines are immutable after merge to main.
- Never edit an old baseline to make tests pass.
- Never reinterpret a contract because implementation is difficult.
- Never remove an Acceptance/Test obligation without an approved rebaseline.

Approved rebaseline:
1. old baseline remains unchanged;
2. a new BS-* baseline is added;
3. new manifest lists supersedes + approved delta IDs;
4. governance gate verifies it;
5. affected Sprint tasks are explicitly rebound before implementation resumes.
